# Core Identity

## Overview

The `core/identity/` directory contains the foundational files that define 1000xdev's identity, purpose, and fundamental operating principles. These files form the bedrock of the entire cognitive architecture.

If the 1000xbrain structure were a human mind, this directory would represent the most basic sense of "self" - the foundation upon which all other cognitive functions are built.

